    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d530-a1">

                <pb facs="0605" n="525" xml:id="pg525"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lord Lansdowne to Mr. Choate</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-05-12"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Ambassador</hi>: I hasten to acknowledge
                    receipt of your letter covering the Secretary of State’s friendly and
                    sympathetic message.</p>
                <p>The feelings which he expresses on behalf of the President and people of the
                    United States will be deeply appreciated in this country as well as by the
                    community which has suffered so much.</p>
                <p>I reserve a more formal acknowledgment until to-morrow.</p>
                <p>Yours, sincerely,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansdowne.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
